# Atmel S336 touch panel (LG D625).
#
# The driver reports KEY_WAKEUP (scancode 143) for a KnockON double tap.
# Generic.kl maps 143 to POWER WAKE, which wakes without a proximity check.
# This layout intentionally maps nothing, so the scancode reaches
# com.cyanogenmod.settings.device.KeyHandler, which wakes through
# PowerManager.wakeUpWithProximityCheck().
